## Updating an existing workflow

After applying the example above, change `monitor.alarm_threshold` from `0.05` to `0.10` in the same resource, leaving its other settings unchanged:

```terraform
monitor = {
  type              = "transition_count"
  window_size       = 100
  alarm_threshold   = 0.10
  recover_threshold = 0
}
```

`terraform plan` shows an in-place update, and `terraform apply` preserves the workflow UUID. Filters and actions also update in place. For example, replace the existing `recover_actions` value with `recover_actions = []` to remove all recovery actions.

Changing `monitor.type` or `test_suite_uuid` instead replaces the workflow.

